### Proves amb l'extensió REST Client de VS Code
### Primer executa els dos logins (guarden el token), després la resta.

### ============ AUTENTICACIÓ ============

### Registre
POST http://localhost:3000/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "anna", "password": "Anna12345" }

### Registre amb usuari repetit (409)
POST http://localhost:3000/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "anna", "password": "Anna12345" }

### Registre amb contrasenya feble (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "anna2", "password": "123" }

### Login ADMIN
# @name loginAdmin
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "Admin1234" }

###
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}

### Login USUARI (maria)
# @name loginMaria
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "maria", "password": "Maria1234" }

###
@mariaToken = {{loginMaria.response.body.token}}

### Login incorrecte (401)
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "maria", "password": "Incorrecta1" }

### Sense token (401)
GET http://localhost:3000/resources

### Logout
POST http://localhost:3000/logout
Content-Type: application/json

### ============ RECURSOS (CRUD 1) ============

### Llistar recursos
GET http://localhost:3000/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{mariaToken}}

### Veure un recurs
GET http://localhost:3000/resources/1
Authorization: Bearer {{mariaToken}}

### Crear recurs (admin)
POST http://localhost:3000/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sala de formació", "type": "sala", "capacity": 12 }

### Crear recurs sent usuari normal (403)
POST http://localhost:3000/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{mariaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Intent", "type": "sala", "capacity": 5 }

### Crear recurs amb dades incorrectes (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/resources
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "A", "type": "sala", "capacity": -3 }

### Modificar recurs (admin)
PUT http://localhost:3000/resources/4
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "capacity": 15 }

### Eliminar recurs (admin)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/resources/4
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ============ RESERVES (CRUD 2) ============

### Llistar les meves reserves
GET http://localhost:3000/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{mariaToken}}

### Crear reserva
# @name newBooking
POST http://localhost:3000/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{mariaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resourceId": 3, "start": "2027-05-10T10:00:00Z", "end": "2027-05-10T12:00:00Z" }

###
@bookingId = {{newBooking.response.body.id}}

### Crear reserva que se solapa (409)
POST http://localhost:3000/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resourceId": 3, "start": "2027-05-10T11:00:00Z", "end": "2027-05-10T13:00:00Z" }

### Reserva amb dates incorrectes (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{mariaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resourceId": 3, "start": "2027-05-10T12:00:00Z", "end": "2027-05-10T10:00:00Z" }

### Veure una reserva
GET http://localhost:3000/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{mariaToken}}

### Veure la reserva d'un altre usuari (403): la reserva 2 és de joan
GET http://localhost:3000/bookings/2
Authorization: Bearer {{mariaToken}}

### Modificar reserva
PUT http://localhost:3000/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{mariaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "end": "2027-05-10T11:30:00Z" }

### Eliminar reserva
DELETE http://localhost:3000/bookings/{{bookingId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{mariaToken}}

### L'admin veu totes les reserves
GET http://localhost:3000/bookings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
